# Prelude to Puissance (jeuno 170), MAX_LEVEL either side of 95 (MAX_LEVEL > 95): a level 91 Warrior with the Limit
# Breaker at cap 95, Dormant Powers Dislodged completed. MAX_LEVEL 95: 10045 (91, 1, 0, 0) (its finish: no handler in
# the available section, nothing); 96: 10194 (91, 1, 6, 2).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10194
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=91
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
setting MAX_LEVEL 95
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # MAX_LEVEL 95: 10045 (91, 1, 0, 0)
finish option=13                        # no 10045 handler while available: nothing
setting MAX_LEVEL 96
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # MAX_LEVEL 96: 10194 (91, 1, 6, 2)
finish                                  # begun
